  - m_Id: 2538974605205504
    m_Localized: A crisp apple that keeps the doctor and dull salads away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974630371328
    m_Localized: Sliced into crunchy wedges, ready to toss in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974630371329
    m_Localized: Seared on the grill until it whispers bellissimo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974630371330
    m_Localized: A thick cut of beef with big Florentine dreams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974630371331
    m_Localized: Boils pasta until it is perfectly al dente.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974630371332
    m_Localized: Golden bruschetta toast with a satisfying crunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565632
    m_Localized: A rustic Italian loaf, crusty outside and soft at heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565633
    m_Localized: A wheel of cheese aged for drama and flavor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565634
    m_Localized: Cheesy snowflakes waiting to fall on pasta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565635
    m_Localized: Creamy, cheesy and smooth enough to win any argument.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565636
    m_Localized: Juicy grilled chicken with proper char lines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565637
    m_Localized: Pale chicken waiting for its moment on the grill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565638
    m_Localized: Chops veggies faster than you can say ciao.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565639
    m_Localized: Seared scallops, sweet as a Venetian sunset.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565640
    m_Localized: A scallop still keeping its shell shut tight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565641
    m_Localized: Cleaned, trimmed and no longer shellfish about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565642
    m_Localized: An empty cup waiting for something fizzy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565643
    m_Localized: Twirled, sauced and served with Italian flair. Mamma mia!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565644
    m_Localized: Crisp, fresh and tossed like a true Italian garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565645
    m_Localized: From the grill and the sea, a feast fit for Sunday in Napoli.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565646
    m_Localized: Fizzy, cold and the perfect sidekick for every plate of pasta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565647
    m_Localized: Soft bow ties all dressed up for dinner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565648
    m_Localized: Little pasta butterflies that have not learned to fly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565649
    m_Localized: Browned and saucy, just like nonna makes it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565650
    m_Localized: Minced beef on its way to becoming a classic ragù.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565651
    m_Localized: Cold cubes that keep every soda chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565652
    m_Localized: A sunny Amalfi lemon with a zesty personality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565653
    m_Localized: Bright lemon slices that make every sip sparkle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565654
    m_Localized: A crisp head of lettuce, fresh from the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565655
    m_Localized: Chopped leaves ready for a proper toss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565656
    m_Localized: Tender tubes, cooked and ready to be stuffed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565657
    m_Localized: Big pasta tubes with plenty of room for filling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565658
    m_Localized: The creamy dressing that holds every salad together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565659
    m_Localized: Grill meets sea on one generous plate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565660
    m_Localized: Fresh milk, the secret behind every creamy sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565661
    m_Localized: Charred octopus, a true taste of the Mediterranean.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565662
    m_Localized: Eight arms and no idea what is coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565663
    m_Localized: Tentacles trimmed and ready for the heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565664
    m_Localized: Sizzles meat and sauces to golden perfection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565665
    m_Localized: A steaming plate of pasta, al dente and proud of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565666
    m_Localized: Fresh greens tossed the Italian way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565667
    m_Localized: Blends silky sauces in one creamy whirl.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565668
    m_Localized: Sizzling shrimp kissed by the flames.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565669
    m_Localized: Little shrimp curled up and feeling shy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2538974634565670
    m_Localized: Peeled and prepped with no shell left to hide in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
